  markers on the map read as one thing.

  Everything is kept inside the 66dp safe zone of the 108dp canvas (a circle centred on
  54,54): the launcher crops this to a circle, a squircle or a rounded square depending on
  the device, and art outside that zone gets cut off on some of them.
-->
